## 6. AdvantageScope 2D Visualization

### 1. Code Implementation (`Mechanism2d`)

```
private final Mechanism2d m_mech = new Mechanism2d(1.0, 2.0);
private final MechanismRoot2d m_root = m_mech.getRoot("ElevatorRoot", 0.5, 0.1);
private final MechanismLigament2d m_fixedFrame = 
    m_root.append(new MechanismLigament2d("Fixed Frame", 1.5, 90, 6, new Color8Bit(Color.kGray)));
private final MechanismLigament2d m_carriage = 
    m_root.append(new MechanismLigament2d("Carriage", 0.1, 90, 10, new Color8Bit(Color.kRed)));

@Override
public void periodic() {
    m_carriage.setLength(getDistanceMeters());
    SmartDashboard.putData("Elevator/Mechanism2D", m_mech);
}
